# Use SDE Skill for Coding Tasks

For any coding task in this repository (writing, editing, reviewing, or refactoring backend, frontend, or dev-script code), **read and follow** the SDE skill before making changes:

`.cursor/skills/sde/SKILL.md`

Do this as the first action on coding work. Apply its principles: keep logic simple, write only what was asked, prefer efficient solutions, and delete dead or no-op code.
